Write a solution to find the people who have the most friends and the most friends number.
The test cases are generated so that only one person has the most friends.


SOLUTION:

WITH Friends AS ((SELECT requester_id id FROM RequestAccepted)
UNION ALL
(SELECT accepter_id id FROM RequestAccepted)) -- union all collects all friendships that have been successfully created, via requests or accepts

SELECT id, COUNT(id) num
FROM Friends
GROUP BY id
ORDER BY num DESC
LIMIT 1 -- takes highest num
